OL,3,GNEWSAKnitalian: Artist uses yarn to
OL,4,Acreate Italian deli
OL,5,
OL,6,FA textile artist has turned a Soho
OL,7,Fgallery into an Italian restaurant and
OL,8,Fdelicatessen - where everything on the
OL,9,Fmenu is made of yarn.
OL,11,FKate Jenkins's exhibition, Kate's
OL,12,FKnitalian, has filled Air Contemporary
OL,13,Fin Ham Yard with knitted, embroidered
OL,14,Fand crocheted food.
OL,16,FSpaghetti, breadsticks, fish, fruit and
OL,17,Fveg are all on the shelves, and artwork
OL,18,Fis available to buy.
OL,20,FJenkins's idea grew out of a year of
OL,21,Feating.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
